5. Audio-first design research
   The new Python audio-first layer is written separately, with no copied upstream modules.
   The privately supplied h3-film source informed the soundtrack/timing/reference-plan design.
   Six reference files with sanitized nonfunctional comments were isolated with SHA-256 hashes
   in the private source archive. They are NOT included in this public export: no root
   source-code license was found and no public redistribution license is asserted, so the
   h3_join backend stays disabled until rights are cleared. Upstream commit identity is
   unverified.

6. img2threejs - https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs
   The procedural Three.js handoff follows its documented assess/build/render/review workflow.
   No upstream implementation is bundled or executed. The handoff is not a trained image-to-mesh
   model or a completed 3D reconstruction.

